0	section	Talking to Straven
1	line	Player	How would I go about getting a Master Thief armband?
1	line	Straven	Ooh... tricky stuff. Took me YEARS to get that rank.
1	line	Straven	Well, what some of the more aspiring thieves in our gang are working on right now is to steal some very valuable candlesticks from Scarface Pete - the pirate leader on Karamja.
1	line	Straven	His security is excellent, and the target very valuable so that might be enough to get you the rank.
1	line	Straven	Go talk to our man Alfonse, the waiter in the Shrimp and Parrot.
1	line	Straven	Use the secret word 'gherkin' to show you're one of us.
1	action	end
