0	section	Talking to Charlie
1	line	Charlie the cook	Hey! What are you doing back here?
1	select	Select an Option.
1	option	I'm looking for a gherkin...
2	line	Player	I'm looking for a gherkin...
2	line	Charlie the cook	Aaaaaah... a fellow Phoenix! So, tell me compadre... what brings you to sunny Brimhaven?
2	select	Select an option
2	option	Sun, sand and the fresh sea air!
3	line	Player	Sun, sand and the fresh sea air!
3	line	Charlie the cook	Well, can't say I blame you compadre. I used to be a city boy myself, but have to admit it's a lot nicer living here nowadays. Brimhaven's certainly good for it.
3	action	end
2	option	I want to steal Scarface Pete's candlesticks.
3	line	Player	I want to steal Scarface Pete's candlesticks.
3	line	Charlie the cook	Ah yes, of course. The candlesticks. Well, I have to be honest with you compadre, we haven't made much progress in that task ourselves so far. We can however offer
3	line	Charlie the cook	a little assistance. The setting up of this restaurant was the start of things; we have a secret door out the back of here that leads through the back of Mr Olbors' garden.
3	line	Charlie the cook	Now, at the other side of Mr Olbors' garden, is an old side entrance to Scarface Pete's mansion. It seems to have been blocked off from the rest of the mansion some years ago
3	line	Charlie the cook	and we can't seem to find a way through. We're positive this is the key to entering the house undetected however, and I promise to let you know if we find anything there.
3	line	Player	Mind if I check it out for myself?
3	line	Charlie the cook	Not at all! The more minds we have working on the problem, the quicker we get that loot!
3	action	end
