0	section	Katrine's request
1	line	Player	Hey.
1	line	Katrine	Hey.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	Who are all those people in there?
1	option	Is there any way I can get the rank of master thief?
2	line	Player	Is there any way I can get the rank of master thief?
2	line	Katrine	Master thief? Ain't we the ambitious one!
2	line	Katrine	Well, you're gonna have to do something pretty amazing.
2	line	Player	Anything you can suggest?
2	line	Katrine	Well, some of the MOST coveted prizes in thiefdom right now are in the pirate town of Brimhaven on Karamja.
2	line	Katrine	The pirate leader Scarface Pete has a pair of extremely valuable candlesticks.
2	line	Katrine	His security is VERY good.
2	line	Katrine	We, of course, have gang members in a town like Brimhaven who may be able to help you.
2	line	Katrine	Visit our hideout in the alleyway on Palm Street. To get in you will need to tell them the secret password 'four leafed clover'.
2	action	end
