0	section	Trobert's plan
1	line	Trobert	Hi. Welcome to our Brimhaven headquarters. I'm Trobert and I'm in charge here.
1	select	Select an option
1	option	So can you help me get Scarface Pete's candlesticks?
2	line	Player	So can you help me get Scarface Pete's candlesticks?
2	line	Trobert	Well, we have made some progress there. We know that one of the only keys to Pete's treasure room is carried by Grip, the head guard, so we thought it might be good to get close to him somehow.
2	line	Trobert	Grip was taking on a new deputy called Hartigen, an Asgarnian Black Knight who was deserting the Black Knight Fortress and seeking new employment here on Brimhaven.
2	line	Trobert	We managed to waylay him on the journey here, and steal his I.D. papers. Now all we need is to find somebody willing to impersonate him and take the deputy role to get that key for us.
2	select	Select an option
2	option	I volunteer to undertake that mission!
3	line	Player	I volunteer to undertake that mission!
3	line	Trobert	Good good. Here's the I.D. papers. Take them and introduce yourself to the guards at Scarface Pete's mansion. We'll have that treasure in no time.
3	action	end
2	option	Well, good luck then.
3	line	Player	Well, good luck then.
3	line	Trobert	Someone will show up eventually.
3	action	end
1	option	Pleased to meet you.
2	line	Player	Pleased to meet you.
2	line	Trobert	Likewise.
2	action	end
