0	section	Talking to the High Priest on Entrana before getting ice gloves
1	line	High Priest	Many greetings. Welcome to our fair island.
1	line	Player	Hello, I am in search of an Entranan Firebird. Can you help me?
1	line	High Priest	Well adventurer, I have heard that they exist on this island, but have not ever seen one myself.
1	line	High Priest	According to legend however, they are so hot that their merest touch can burn flesh.
1	line	High Priest	Apparently long ago a great hero used a pair of magical gloves, stolen from the Queen of the Ice to cool the bird down enough to catch as a pet.
1	line	Player	So where would I find this 'Queen of the Ice' then?
1	line	High Priest	I know not adventurer, it was just a myth I was told as a young boy. Perhaps somewhere icy?
1	line	Player	Thanks!
1	action	end
