0	section	Speaking to Achietties
1	line	Achietties	Greetings. Welcome to the Heroes' Guild.
1	line	Achietties	How goes thy quest adventurer?
1	line	Player	I have all the required items.
1	line	Achietties	I see that you have. Well done; Now, to complete the quest, and gain entry to the Heroes' Guild in your final task all that you have to do is...
1	line	Player	W-what? What do you mean? There's MORE???
1	line	Achietties	I'm sorry, I was just having a little fun with you. Just a little Heroes' Guild humour there. What I really meant was
1	line	Achietties	Congratulations! You have completed the Heroes' Guild entry requirements! You will find the door now open for you! Enter, Hero! And take this reward!
